:\"0771234567\",\"applicationNumber\":\"VISA-2026-0001\",\"documentName\":\"Bank Statement (Last 6 Months)\",\"rejectionReason\":\"Document scan is blurry and missing official bank stamp\"}}', '{\"messaging_product\":\"whatsapp\",\"contacts\":[{\"input\":\"94771234567\",\"wa_id\":\"94771234567\"}],\"messages\":[{\"id\":\"wamid.HBgCCE46B113B94389AD92C48C556DE==\"}],\"simulated\":true}', NULL, '0', '3', NULL, '2026-08-24 06:28:11', '2026-08-24 09:58:11');
